  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive, green and sustainable local economy in selected cities in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The INCLU-CITIES project&lt;/b&gt; (Inclusive, green and sustainable local economy in selected cities in Tanzania) aims to create greener and more inclusive cities, new green jobs and enterprises and to grow the existing ones.    Its specific objectives are : (1) Availability and usage of quality Business Development Service and accessible financial services and capital investment in key economic sectors improved; (2) The value chains of key economic sectors are strengthened through improved access, relevance, and quality of skills development and entrepreneurship promotion.</narrative>
  </description>
